1
00:00:21,327 --> 00:00:31,402
I watched you break upon the keys.
Crying out to silent trees.

2
00:00:31,527 --> 00:00:41,641
I bleed with you, I feel your cry.
Now the storm has just begun.

3
00:00:42,147 --> 00:00:51,857
I want to fill your empty space,
To feel the fever of your skin!

4
00:00:52,528 --> 00:01:00,598
Lost inside this secret place,
Where the sin and grace begin!

5
00:01:02,032 --> 00:01:11,837
Walking home under the frost.
Thinking of the love you lost.

6
00:01:12,382 --> 00:01:21,285
Sitting close, but miles apart.
But you are fading in the night.

7
00:01:22,602 --> 00:01:32,269
I give you all my heat and wet,
To melt the ice inside your chest.

8
00:01:32,728 --> 00:01:41,768
A night we never will forget,
The sleeping lion on my breast!

9
00:01:42,259 --> 00:01:52,296
Alone inside the dusty shed.
All the words we never said.

10
00:01:52,401 --> 00:02:01,459
I hold you close, you grip my back.
In the garage, soft and low.

11
00:02:03,020 --> 00:02:12,549
I want to fill your empty space,
To feel the fever of your skin!

12
00:02:13,265 --> 00:02:21,035
Lost inside this secret place,
Where the sin and grace begin!

13
00:02:22,572 --> 00:02:32,325
My lips find yours, deep and raw.
Breaking every sacred law.

14
00:02:32,961 --> 00:02:41,272
Hands are sliding under cloth.
Drowning in a wild desire.

15
00:02:43,402 --> 00:02:52,512
I give you all my heat and wet,
To melt the ice inside your chest.

16
