A night we never will forget,
The sleeping lion on my breast!

17
00:03:03,032 --> 00:03:12,983
Unbuckle belt, I slip inside.
No more secrets left to hide.

18
00:03:13,312 --> 00:03:23,366
Skirt pulled high, I guide your touch.
We have broken through at last.

19
